# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local virtualenv for the bundled MCP server. `uv run` from mcp/ recreates it
# on demand, so it is never shipped. This is the runtime artifact.
#
# mcp/uv.lock is deliberately NOT ignored: it is a resolution record, not a
# runtime file, and uv states it "should be checked into version control"
# (https://docs.astral.sh/uv/concepts/projects/layout). Same split as
# node_modules/ vs package-lock.json. Refresh it with `uv lock --upgrade`.
mcp/.venv/
.venv/

*/.plugin-eval/**/*
